SUMMARY:e-Energy 2027: Abstract registration (fall deadline) (23:59 AoE)
DESCRIPTION:ACM International Conference on Future and Sustainable Energy S
 ystems (e-Energy 2027)\n\nAbstract registration (fall deadline): 11 Sept 2
 026\, 23:59 AoE\n\nConference: June 5-11\, 2027\nLocation: Atlanta\, USA\n
 Venue: Hyatt Regency Atlanta\n\nAll dates:\n  Abstract registration (fall 
 deadline): 11 Sept 2026\, 23:59 AoE\n  Paper submission (fall deadline): 1
 8 Sept 2026\, 23:59 AoE\n  Author notification (fall deadline): 6 Nov 2026
 \, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Revision submission (fall deadline): 20 Nov 2
 026\, 23:59 AoE\n  Revision notification (fall deadline): 10 Dec 2026\, 23
 :59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Abstract registration (winter deadline): 8 Jan 202
 7\, 23:59 AoE\n  Paper submission (winter deadline): 15 Jan 2027\, 23:59 A
 oE\n  Author notification (winter deadline): 5 Mar 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (as
 sumed)\n  Revision submission (winter deadline): 19 Mar 2027\, 23:59 AoE\n
   Revision notification (winter deadline): 16 Apr 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (ass
 umed)\n  Camera-ready due (both deadlines): 30 Apr 2027\, 23:59 AoE\n\nThe
  call for papers states no timezone. This is counted as UTC+12\, the earli
 est it could plausibly mean\, so the countdown runs out before the real de
 adline rather than after it.\n\n18th edition\, part of the inaugural ACM S
 ustainability Week. Two submission rounds: fall (closed) and winter. Paper
 s rejected in the fall round may not be resubmitted in the winter round. A
 uthors pick one of four tracks on HotCRP\; the winter submission site open
 s about three weeks before its deadline. Notification dates state no time 
 or timezone.\n\nCall for papers: https://energy.acm.org/conferences/eenerg
 y/2027/\nDetails: https://powersystemdeadlines.org/preview/pr-7/conference
 /e-energy27
LOCATION:Atlanta\, USA
URL;VALUE=URI:https://energy.acm.org/conferences/eenergy/2027/
CATEGORIES:Smart Grid,Computation & Optimization,Energy Markets,Renewables
